  "title": "Renasant Corporation Increases Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "TUPELO, Miss., Oct. 28, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- The board of directors of Renasant Corporation (NYSE: RNST) approved the payment of a quarterly cash dividend of twenty-three cents ($0.23) per share to be paid January 1, 2026, to shareholders of record as of December 18, 2025.",
